  "251:0 metadata-line a document that renders one way on one system (say, a GitHub",
  "252:0 metadata-line renders differently on another (say, converting to docbook u",
  "253:0 metadata-line pandoc).  To make matters worse, because nothing in Markdown",
  "254:0 metadata-line as a "syntax error," the divergence often isn't discovered r",
  "258:0 metadata-line This document attempts to specify Markdown syntax unambiguou",
  "259:0 metadata-line It contains many examples with side-by-side Markdown and",
  "260:0 metadata-line HTML.  These are intended to double as conformance tests.  A",
  "261:0 metadata-line accompanying script \`spec_tests.py\` can be used to run the t",
  "262:0 metadata-line against any Markdown program:",
  "264:0 metadata-line     python test/spec_tests.py --spec spec.txt --program PROG",
  "266:0 metadata-line Since this document describes how Markdown is to be parsed i",
  "267:0 metadata-line an abstract syntax tree, it would have made sense to use an ",
  "268:0 metadata-line representation of the syntax tree instead of HTML.  But HTML",
  "269:0 metadata-line of representing the structural distinctions we need to make,",
  "270:0 metadata-line choice of HTML for the tests makes it possible to run the te",
  "271:0 metadata-line an implementation without writing an abstract syntax tree re",
  "273:0 metadata-line Note that not every feature of the HTML samples is mandated ",
  "274:0 metadata-line the spec.  For example, the spec says what counts as a link",
  "275:0 metadata-line destination, but it doesn't mandate that non-ASCII character",
  "276:0 metadata-line the URL be percent-encoded.  To use the automatic tests,",
  "277:0 metadata-line implementers will need to provide a renderer that conforms t",
  "278:0 metadata-line the expectations of the spec examples (percent-encoding",
  "279:0 metadata-line non-ASCII characters in URLs).  But a conforming implementat",
  "280:0 metadata-line can use a different renderer and may choose not to",
  "281:0 metadata-line percent-encode non-ASCII characters in URLs.",
  "283:0 metadata-line This document is generated from a text file, \`spec.txt\`, wri",
