  "660:0 metadata-line [Decimal numeric character",
  "661:0 metadata-line references](@)",
  "662:0 metadata-line consist of \`&#\` + a string of 1--7 arabic digits + \`;\`. A",
  "663:0 metadata-line numeric character reference is parsed as the corresponding",
